sequenceDiagram
    participant Sched as BullMQ repeatable job
    participant Coord as EgressEventsIngestCoordinator
    participant Queue as Controller queue
    participant Worker as EgressEventsIngestUnit
    participant Ingest as EgressEventsIngestService
    participant Proxy as ClientAgentProxyService
    participant Mgr as Agent Manager<br/>(GET /api/egress/events)
    participant Stats as StatisticsService
    participant Pub as AgenstraNotificationPublisher
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Sched,DB: egress-events-ingest.coordinator / .unit (EGRESS_EVENTS_INGEST_INTERVAL_MS, default 30s)

    Sched->>Coord: tick (egress-events-ingest.coordinator)
    Coord->>Ingest: findClientIdsDue(EGRESS_EVENTS_INGEST_BATCH_SIZE)
    Ingest->>DB: SELECT client ids + egress ingest cursors
    Ingest-->>Coord: never-polled first, then least recently polled
    loop Each due client
        Coord->>Queue: enqueue egress-events-ingest.unit (jobId per client)
    end

    Queue->>Worker: egress-events-ingest.unit { clientId }
    Worker->>Ingest: ingestClient(clientId)
    Ingest->>DB: load cursor (lastSeq)

    loop Up to 10 pages of 500 events
        Ingest->>Proxy: listClientEgressEvents(clientId, afterSeq, 500)
        Proxy->>Mgr: GET /api/egress/events?afterSeq=&limit=500
        Mgr-->>Proxy: { events, nextSeq, hasMore }
        Proxy-->>Ingest: page
        Ingest->>Stats: recordEgressEvents(clientId, events)
        Stats->>DB: INSERT statistics_egress_events (dedupe by source seq)
        Ingest->>Ingest: advance cursor to nextSeq
    end

    alt Manager answers 404 (no egress feed)
        Ingest->>DB: save cursor lastError = egress feed not available
    else Success
        Ingest->>DB: save cursor (lastSeq, lastIngestedAt)
    end

    Ingest->>Pub: egress.blocked / egress.observed (grouped per agent, host, rule; capped per run)
    Ingest->>Pub: egress.guard_failed (guard error events)
    Note over Pub: Delivered as webhooks / email; /audit reads statistics_egress_events
